@startuml
title ChatHealthy.ai — Target Local Component Architecture\nthe target shape on one workstation, in Docker

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

actor "Consumer\n(browser)" as user

package "Workstation · Docker" #fdfdfd {

  [ch-website\nstatic wrapper + React,\nserved from deployment/web] as WEB

  package "ch-sharedsvc" #fbfdfd {
    [Gate\nfacade — the one entrance] as GATE
    [UniversalNavigator\ntriage · route · render ledger · merge ·\nsessions · security helpers] as UN
    [UtteranceManager\nclassify · RequestUsersRefinement()\n(no route/slot, UM LLM authors) ·\nRequestUsersRefinement(question)\n(tool authored, UM delivers)] as UM
    [Selection · About · ...] as SST
  }

  package "ch-findcare" #fbfdfd {
    [UniversalNavigatorProxy] as FCPX
    [ProviderSearch · ProviderDetail ·\nSpecialtyFilter · Geo ·\nFacilitySearch · FacilityDetail · ClinicalTrials] as FCT
  }

  package "ch-evalcare" #fbfdfd {
    [UniversalNavigatorProxy] as ECPX
    [Scoring and ranking] as ECT
  }
}

database "MongoDB Atlas — ChatHealthyFrontEnd (one cluster)" as FE {
  [ChatHealthyConfig\ntechnical/config —\nDBVersions · ToolConfiguration\n(live registry, env=local) · CertificateRegistry] as CFG
  [Users\nuser/session —\nusers · sessions · render ledger ·\nUserLockOutUtterances] as USR
  [PublicHealthData + ProprietaryData\ncore business —\nProvider table · NUCC/SpecialtyMetaData ·\nprovider/specialty flags] as PHD
}

[Key Vault\ncerts and secrets (one vault)] as KV
[Model + embedding APIs\n(pydantic-ai, inside tools)] as AI

user --> WEB : https://localhost
WEB --> GATE : every call, one POST
GATE --> UN : token, head, parameters
UN --> UM : classify the utterance
UN --> SST : dispatch (in-process)
UN --> FCPX : dispatch (host.docker.internal)
UN --> ECPX : dispatch (host.docker.internal)
FCPX --> FCT
ECPX --> ECT
FCT -[#9ca3af]up-> FCPX : completion callback
UN --> CFG : reads the live map at startup\n(ChatHealthyToolRegistrySchema)
UN --> USR : sessions, the render ledger
FCT --> PHD
UM .down.> AI : classify (+ RequestUsersRefinement())
KV .up.> GATE : certs
KV .up.> FCPX : certs
FCT .down.> AI

note bottom of UN
  Local differs from a Space only in the peer
  address: a co-resident tool answers in-process,
  a container tool answers through host.docker.internal.
  The tool's code is identical either way. No Caddy,
  no per-service facade, no op table — the three old
  app.py collapse into this one generic Gate.
end note

note bottom of FE
  Data is versioned, not environment-segregated:
  one live registry record for env=local, generation
  chosen by ChatHealthyConfig.DBVersions bindings — no
  dev_/qa_/prod_ databases. All four environments bind
  the SAME store, vault and data generation; the binding
  is a record value, so environments are separated by a
  commit, not by infrastructure.

  Migration in progress: from NO data-management to
  real-time versioning. The legacy env-prefixed FindCare
  databases (dev_/qa_/prod_PublicHealthData, dev_/qa_System,
  qa_repo, *_Debug) are garbage under this model and MUST
  be pruned. The pipeline cluster (ChatHealthyDataPipelines)
  builds and stages the core-business tables; migration
  copies them here name-preserving — see the Data
  Architecture chapter and sys_data_flow.
end note
@enduml
